<title>UK: BOE allots 708 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 708 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 708 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 138 million stg in bills outright and 570 million stg in repos to April 9, 10 and 11.</p>
<p>The forecast shortage is 2.3 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
